This is a placeholder for the Wrench-Bee mascot image.
For deployment, you'll need to upload the actual image_22.png file.

The current HTML references this image in:
- Favicon: <link rel="icon" href="image_22.png" type="image/png">
- Navigation: <img src="image_22.png" style="width: 40px; height: 40px; object-fit: contain;" />

To fix this:
1. Upload your actual image_22.png file to this directory
2. Or replace with a different logo file
3. Update the HTML to reference the correct image path
